#: frappe/public/js/frappe/ui/permission_dialog.js:74
msgid "Allows the user to send emails linked to the document."
msgstr "Хэрэглэгчид баримт бичигтэй холбогдсон имэйл илгээх боломжийг олгоно."

#: frappe/public/js/frappe/ui/permission_dialog.js:64
msgid "Allows the user to share document access with other users who may not have access to the document themselves."
